 "brief": "Israeli occupation authorities have renewed a six-month expulsion order against Muhammad Hussein, the grand mufti of Jerusalem and the Palestinian territories and preacher at Al-Aqsa Mosque, according to Maan Wire. The decision prohibits Hussein from entering the mosque during the extended period.\n\nThe renewed ban marks another chapter in what appears to be a sustained campaign by Israeli authorities to restrict Hussein's presence at the holy site. The expulsion order remains in force for half a year from the date of renewal.",
